' @test valid
' @role test
' @status stable
' @dialect en-standard
' @covers Mod.Result
' @description RESULT descriptions with arbitrary prose: dots, @, !, brackets, quotes (D-0051)

RECEIVE request
END

THINK analysis
  GOAL <<
  Analyze the request.
  >>
  RESULT
  * summary: TEXT - brief summary of config.json analysis
  * assignee: TEXT - responsible person @ivan
  * tool_used: TEXT - analysis via !search tool
  * note: TEXT - important (see details) for "production"
  * priority: CHOICE(low, medium, high) - severity level 1.0+
END

WAIT
  ON ?analysis
END

EXIT
